WEBVTT

00:00:01.290 --> 00:00:02.229
Hi, I'm Zinnia!

00:00:02.229 --> 00:00:05.984
Chain of thought is slow because the model writes every step out,

00:00:05.984 --> 00:00:07.549
one token at a time.

00:00:07.549 --> 00:00:09.427
LOTUS thinks in hidden states instead.

00:00:10.767 --> 00:00:14.535
The idea: loop the same model over a fixed block of latent

00:00:14.535 --> 00:00:16.419
slots, refining them all at once.

00:00:16.419 --> 00:00:19.245
Then ground every slot in a real reasoning token.

00:00:21.133 --> 00:00:25.488
After the question, LOTUS pads in a latent region: six blocks of

00:00:25.488 --> 00:00:28.391
twenty-five learnable slots, a hundred and fifty positions.

00:00:28.811 --> 00:00:32.568
The same base model runs over every slot at once, adding its

00:00:32.568 --> 00:00:33.821
last output back in.

00:00:33.821 --> 00:00:36.952
Six passes for the whole trace, not one per token.

00:00:37.371 --> 00:00:41.148
Each slot is then read through the ordinary LM head, and trained

00:00:41.148 --> 00:00:43.666
toward the gold chain-of-thought token that belongs there.

00:00:44.086 --> 00:00:47.511
One more forward pass reads the finished latents and writes the answer,

00:00:47.511 --> 00:00:48.939
which gets its own loss.

00:00:50.383 --> 00:00:51.418
Both losses matter.

00:00:51.418 --> 00:00:55.559
Alone, each leaves latents that decode to the gold step nine point

00:00:55.559 --> 00:00:58.665
one or nine point four percent of the time.

00:00:58.665 --> 00:01:00.045
Together, seventy point nine.

00:01:01.633 --> 00:01:05.516
Six passes don't grow with the rationale, so thinking gets two point

00:01:05.516 --> 00:01:09.399
five to six point nine times faster, about a point and a

00:01:09.399 --> 00:01:10.693
half behind explicit accuracy.

00:01:11.850 --> 00:01:16.293
The loop removes the sequential bottleneck; the supervision stops the drift.

00:01:16.293 --> 00:01:19.120
Together, latent reasoning keeps pace at 3B.

00:01:20.483 --> 00:01:24.317
To recap: a fixed latent region, one model looped over it, and

00:01:24.317 --> 00:01:26.234
a gold token for every slot.

00:01:26.234 --> 00:01:28.151
A fixed budget, chosen in advance.

00:01:28.571 --> 00:01:30.706
Every source is in the full article.

00:01:30.706 --> 00:01:31.316
I'm Zinnia.

00:01:31.316 --> 00:01:31.621
Bye!
